	(text "!!IMPORTANT!!\nDont use a pin\njumper on the 5V\nisolation pin if\nan external power\nsupply is used.\nThis will damage\nyour computer USB\nsupply and likely more"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.51 104.14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.762 0.762)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "163c5e43-4da6-4375-896b-cf2a03369ef5")
	)
	(text "CLASS D AMPLIFIER FILTERING AND BREAKOUT"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 110.49 126.238 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "4aba1605-47ea-40c0-bf72-eb9508413d60")
	)
	(text "Use 2.54 jumper pin Shunts to\nshort these terminals.\nThis will simply act as a testing\npoint for osciloscope\nuse and also act as\nredundancy if the used\nGPIO are damaged"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 212.344 112.522 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
			)
			(justify right)
		)
		(uuid "545c2a2e-479e-48d8-bfcf-27b9cdb5cb5f")
	)
	(text "ESP32 Devikit C breakout\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 62.23 25.146 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "88ed8191-2613-4c95-8bc4-d6f1b8b819b4")
	)
	(text "When using the PCM5102GY module you must cross some solder\nbridges for correct setup.\n\nbridge the SCK pad to GND on the front of the module to enable\ninternal PLL clock generation.\n\nOn the underside, bridge H1L, H2L and H4L to the left position,\nand H3L to the right position to unmute the DAC.\n\nThe module will produce no audio output\nif H3L is left in the default left position."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 138.684 78.486 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.889 0.889)
			)
		)
		(uuid "9f31ec07-c3a3-49ea-8ab5-ae6d9635b56c")
	)
	(text "All 0805 SMD components have the handsodlerable version of their respective footpint\nThe only component that needs some SMD reflow work is the PAM8403 amp"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 222.504 156.21 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
		)
		(uuid "cd3f3ff2-531d-4ac7-8890-ec13de265376")
	)
	(text "In the printed deisng there is no\nfiltering capacitors on either the\ninput or output of the design.\n\nAs shown in the in the LM1117T's data\nsheet, I should have used two 1uF\ncapacitors on both Vin and vout terminals \nto ensure a stable output\n\nThe current configuration has a minimal effect\non the final result."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 110.744 109.728 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
			)
			(justify right)
		)
		(uuid "cf50dc44-3ee7-4533-ad7b-80111bef0b19")
	)
	(text "STERO DAC"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 139.192 26.416 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "f48b9cfb-2bc7-49ed-9be8-4865c3d4c72a")
	)
